				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Let’s take a look at a parabolic long setup. These are not very common but any time a successful parabolic short goes down 50-60%+ in a few days, that’s the premise for the long setup. Entry is opening range highs or the first green 5-minute candle or any range break to the upside if the stock doesn’t rally out of the gate, which they usually do. These things can bounce 50-100% in a few days.</p>						</div>
