				<p>Thanks very much for all you do for the trading community!</p>
<p>One quick question about the entry. Do you have to trade off the opening range breakout on an intraday chart? Or do you ever leave an order to buy above a breakout level on a daily chart with a stop loss at the low of the previous day? </p>
